over:text-sky-300 bg-transparent font-medium rounded-full px-6\">Sign In</button></div></div></div></nav><main class=\"flex-1\"><section id=\"hero\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 bg-[url(&#x27;/images/person-doing-yoga-nature.jpg&#x27;)] bg-cover bg-center\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950/85 via-slate-950/55 to-slate-950/10\"></div><div class=\"relative container mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-12 lg:py-28 xl:px-20\"><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/images/men-vibe-logo.png\" alt=\"Men Vibe\" class=\"h-10 w-auto\"/><span class=\"rounded-full bg-slate-900/70 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-300\">Mindful masculinity platform</span></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><h1 class=\"max-w-2xl text-balance text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-50 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">Transform your energy, focus &amp; daily rhythm.</h1><p class=\"max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-lg\">Build rituals, habits, and a calm mindset that carry you through the day. Men Vibe gives you a clear, minimalist system to structure your mornings, move your body, and reset your mind.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 dark:border-transparent dark:bg-black dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-black/90 h-11 rounded-full px-8 text-sm font-semibold sm:text-base bg-sky-500 border border-sky-500 text-white hover:bg-sky-400 hover:text-white\" href=\"/auth?tab=signup\">Start your journey</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-11 rounded-full px-8 border border-sky-500 bg-white/95 text-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-50 hover:text-sky-700\" href=\"#features\">Explore Men Vibe</a></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300 sm:text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-sky-400\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>No distractions, no noise</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-sky-400\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Built on daily discipline</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-sky-400\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>For modern, mindful men</span></div></div></div></section><section id=\"archetypes\" class=\"bg-slate-50 py-14 sm:py-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 xl:px-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-left lg:text-left\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-sky-700\">Why Men Vibe works</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-balance text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl\">Structure for your rituals. Clarity for your mind. Momentum for your life.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-slate-900 sm:text-base\" style=\"color:#3d3d3d\">Men Vibe gives you a clear path: daily structure, simple training, and results you can actually feel. Every ritual, lesson, and training plan is intentional, so you can move through each day with focus, presence, and calm strength.</p></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border shadow-sm border-slate-200 bg-slate-900 text-slate-50\"><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-row items-center gap-3 space-y-0 pb-3\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"tracking-tight text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50\">Daily ritual builder</div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Design clear morning, evening, and micro-routines with reminders that fit your actual life, not an ideal schedule.</div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border shadow-sm border-slate-200 bg-slate-900 text-slate-50\"><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-row items-center gap-3 space-y-0 pb-3\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"tracking-tight text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50\">Mindful masculinity lessons</div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Short, grounded articles that keep you calm, clear, and steady when life gets loud.</div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border shadow-sm border-slate-200 bg-slate-900 text-slate-50\"><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-row items-center gap-3 space-y-0 pb-3\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-4 w-4\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><div class=\"tracking-tight text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50\">Habit tracker &amp; training</div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Track rituals, strength, mobility, and micro-habits with simple streaks and clear progress.</div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border shadow-sm border-slate-200 bg-slate-900 text-slate-50\"><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-row items-center gap-3 space-y-0 pb-3\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"tracking-tight text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50\">Audio rituals &amp; achievements</div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Grounding audio, reflections, and 40 structured achievements that reward consistency—not perfection.</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-slate-950 py-16 sm:py-18 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 xl:px-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\"><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-balance text-2xl font-semibold text-sky-300 sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl\">Begin Your Men Vibe Journey</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-base\">A calmer mind, a stronger body, a more intentional life—built through daily rituals.</p><div class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 dark:border-transparent dark:bg-black dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-black/90 h-11 rounded-full px-8 text-sm font-semibold sm:text-base bg-sky-500 border border-sky-500 text-white hover:bg-sky-400 hover:text-white\" href=\"/auth?tab=signup\">Start your journey</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"bg-slate-50 py-14 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 border-t border-slate-200\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 xl:px-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-sky-600\">Features inside Men Vibe</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-balance text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl\">Everything you need to design your day with intention.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base\">From ritual creation to movement, mindset, and reflection, Men Vibe brings all of your core practices into one calm, focused space.</p></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground shadow-sm border-slate-200 bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col p-6 space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-600\">Rituals</p><div class=\"tracking-tight text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Daily Ritual Builder</div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Build morning, evening, and micro-rituals with clear steps, timing, and reminders.</div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground shadow-sm border-slate-200 bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col p-6 space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-600\">Content</p><div class=\"tracking-tight text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Articles &amp; Audio Rituals</div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Access short, focused articles plus breathwork, grounding, and reset audios for any moment.</div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground shadow-sm border-slate-200 bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col p-6 space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-600\">Progress</p><div class=\"tracking-tight text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Tracker, Journal &amp; Achievements</div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Track streaks, capture insights in a guided journal, and unlock 40 structured achievements as you move forward.</div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"testimonials\" class=\"border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-950 py-16 sm:py-18 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 xl:px-20\"><div class=\"grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,0.9fr)]\"><div class=\"space-y-5\"><p class=\"text-xs font-sem